---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" title="NACUAA Washington State (Seattle) Golf Club Officially Established" description="NACUAA Washington State (Seattle) Golf Club has been officially established! Welcome alumni and friends across Greater Seattle to scan the WeChat QR code to join." path="/en/posts/2026-08-27-golf-club-announcement/">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20">
    <a href="/en/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-x-2 text-sm text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-400 mb-8 transition-colors">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i>
      <span>Back to Home</span>
    </a>

    <article class="space-y-8">
      <header class="border-b border-slate-900 pb-8 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-x-3 text-xs text-slate-500 mb-2">
          <time datetime="2026-08-27">August 27, 2026</time>
          <span>·</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20 font-semibold">Announcement</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
          🏌️‍♂️ NACUAA Washington State (Seattle) Golf Club Officially Established
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-x-2">
          <span>Direct URI Path: <a href="/golf/" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline font-mono">wa.nacuaa.ai/golf</a></span>
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="text-slate-300 space-y-6 leading-relaxed text-base">
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-200 font-medium">
          Hello alumni and golf enthusiasts!
        </p>

        <p>
          To enrich the athletic and social life of university alumni across Greater Seattle and Washington State, the <strong>NACUAA Washington State (Seattle) Golf Club</strong> is officially established!
        </p>

        <div class="p-5 bg-slate-900/80 border-l-4 border-emerald-500 rounded-r-2xl text-slate-200 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-2">
          <p class="font-bold text-white">⛳ Club Overview:</p>
          <p>
            The Golf Club is dedicated to organizing beginner workshops, driving range meetups, 18-hole rounds, and alumni golf tournaments across premier PNW courses. Everyone from beginners to seasoned players is welcome!
          </p>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-emerald-500 pl-3">📱 Scan QR Code to Join WeChat Group</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
          Interested alumni and friends in Greater Seattle and Washington State are welcome to scan the WeChat QR code below. <em>(Note: Shown in thumbnail size; click image to open/save full size)</em>
        </p>

        <!-- WeChat QR Code Container: Small Display with Click to Full Size -->
        <div class="my-8 text-center bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-3xl">
          <a href="/images/golf_wechat_qr.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block group" title="Click for full size">
            <img 
              src="/images/golf_wechat_qr.jpg" 
              alt="NACUAA WA Golf Club WeChat QR Code" 
              class="w-64 h-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 shadow-2xl mx-auto group-hover:border-emerald-500 group-hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all duration-300"
            />
          </a>
          <p class="text-xs text-emerald-400 mt-3 font-medium">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass-plus mr-1"></i> Click image above to view full size
          </p>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-emerald-500 pl-3">🌐 Direct URI Path Subsite</h3>
        <p className="text-sm text-slate-300">
          For convenient access and sharing, the Golf Club has enabled a direct URI path:<br />
          👉 <a href="/golf/" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline font-mono font-bold">wa.nacuaa.ai/golf</a>
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-emerald-500 pl-3">📞 Leaders & Contact Info</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-200 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-2xl">
          <li>· <strong>Washington State Chapter President Ashley Qi</strong> (ashley@nacuaa.ai)</li>
          <li>· <strong>NACUAA AI Club Chairman Michael</strong> (Michael Huo)</li>
        </ul>

        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 pt-4 border-t border-slate-900">
          Feel free to share this with fellow golf lovers!
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
